<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Cancelled — Random Ten</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
  <style>
    body { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; text-align:center; }
    .result-card { max-width:520px; padding:60px 48px; background:var(--navy-light); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:8px; }
    .result-icon { font-size:48px; margin-bottom:24px; opacity:0.5; }
    .result-card h1 { font-size:28px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .result-card p { color:var(--grey); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:32px; }
    .btn-row { display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="result-card">
    <div class="result-icon">○</div>
    <p style="color:var(--gold);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.25em;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px">RANDOM TEN</p>
    <h1>No problem.</h1>
    <p>Your payment was cancelled and nothing was charged. When you are ready, your place is still here.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn--outline">Back to Home</a>
      <a href="/#pricing" class="btn btn--gold">Try Again</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
